stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> OPEN
    OPEN --> HALTED : a trade moves the price ≥ 10%\nfrom the 60 s high/low (CircuitBreaker)
    HALTED --> AUCTION : 30 s later (exchange clock tick)
    AUCTION --> OPEN : 30 s later — uncross at one price (CallAuction)
    OPEN : OpenState\norders match as they arrive
    HALTED : HaltedState\nnew orders refused, cancels allowed
    AUCTION : AuctionState\nlimit orders collected, indicative price published
